#: src/modules/Client/templates/admin/mod_client_summary_cards.html.twig
msgid "Each active or suspended service is cancelled as with Cancel on its order page: the server account is cancelled, its open renewal and first invoices are cancelled, a payment subscription stops and the client gets the usual email. Nothing is refunded and no credit is given."
